## **6. Mixture of Experts (MoE)**

**Vanilla:**

* Single dense FFN.

**Modern LLMs (Switch, Mixtral):**

* Many expert FFNs.
* Router selects top-k experts per token.

**Math:**

$$
y = \sum_{i \in \text{TopK}(x)} p_i(x) \cdot \text{Expert}_i(x)
$$

**Code:**

```python
# MoE forward
experts_out = [expert(x) for expert in experts]
weights = router(x)  # choose top-k experts
out = sum(w * e for w, e in zip(weights, experts_out))
```

